{"id":"diagram-revision-1b74b8fa-8210-449d-b9d4-d04968afecf9","diagramId":"diagram-5d2bc009-df74-4f64-a3d4-75d756b9582f","parentId":"diagram-revision-a849b15f-57a6-426b-92dc-62e17d22034e","diagram":{"id":"overview","revision":2,"diagramId":"diagram-5d2bc009-df74-4f64-a3d4-75d756b9582f","revisionId":"diagram-revision-1b74b8fa-8210-449d-b9d4-d04968afecf9","content":{"revisionId":"overview:2","ascii":"Saved CanvasViews and branching\n|\n+-- Give the current canvas a lasting name\n|   +-- Create a view: save immediately and make it active\n|   |   `-- CanvasHistory.canvasView({ operation: 'create', name })\n|   `-- A saved checkpoint pins the canvas and its diagram revisions\n|       +-- Existing checkpoints never change\n|       `-- finalCheckpointId identifies the latest saved endpoint\n|\n+-- Continue work inside a view\n|   +-- Edit freely; the current canvas may differ from its saved state\n|   |   `-- The dirty indicator ignores camera and selection-only changes\n|   +-- Save when this state should become the new baseline for forks\n|   |   +-- Retain earlier checkpoints and append the current one if new\n|   |   +-- Clear this view's stashed working copy\n|   |   `-- operation: 'save' / Ctrl+S; checkpointIds retains saved history\n|   `-- Leave and return without losing unsaved edits\n|       +-- Switching away stashes the outgoing active view's current state\n|       |   `-- stashCanvasView(): workingCopies[viewId] = headId\n|       `-- Reopen the target view, keeping the current camera in place\n|           +-- Has a working copy? Resume those edits\n|           +-- Otherwise: restore its latest saved checkpoint\n|           `-- openCanvasView(): resuming work does not save a new endpoint\n|\n`-- Explore branches from a saved checkpoint\n    +-- Save parent edits first if the children should include them\n    +-- Fork one child: create it and open it for independent editing\n    |   `-- operation: 'fork', viewId, name\n    `-- Create a group of alternatives from ONE pinned parent checkpoint\n        +-- Each child can evolve independently; the parent stays intact\n        +-- Copy creation leaves the current canvas open\n        |   `-- operation: 'alternatives' creates copies; generation is separate\n        +-- Ancestry records both the parent and the exact branching point\n        |   +-- parentViewId + forkCheckpointId; alternativeGroupId groups peers\n        |   `-- Later parent saves do not move an existing child's fork point\n        `-- Decide which branches remain available\n            +-- Keep an alternative when the user chooses it\n            |   +-- Open or resume the chosen view, then save it\n            |   +-- Retain the chosen view and its descendants\n            |   `-- Archive the other alternatives in that group\n            |       `-- Also archive every descendant of those siblings\n            +-- Discard a view to archive its entire descendant branch\n            |   `-- If the active view belongs to that branch\n            |       +-- Open the discarded view's parent if available\n            |       `-- Otherwise clear the active view\n            `-- Archiving hides branches from the explorer\n                +-- Saved checkpoints and ancestry remain retained\n                `-- operation: 'keep' / 'discard' sets archivedAt on retired views","asciiSha256":"8b1b7a6768664219695f2e789b00359962206a95e6ae4e703a0cba0b73a9786f","structure":{"kind":"tree","parserVersion":"ascii-tree-2","rootIds":["overview:2:8b1b7a6768664219695f2e789b00359962206a95e6ae4e703a0cba0b73a9786f:line-1"],"nodes":{"overview:2:8b1b7a6768664219695f2e789b00359962206a95e6ae4e703a0cba0b73a9786f:line-1":{"id":"overview:2:8b1b7a6768664219695f2e789b00359962206a95e6ae4e703a0cba0b73a9786f:line-1","label":"Saved CanvasViews and branching","line":1,"branchColumn":-1,"startColumn":1,"endColumn":31,"childIds":["overview:2:8b1b7a6768664219695f2e789b00359962206a95e6ae4e703a0cba0b73a9786f:line-3","overview:2:8b1b7a6768664219695f2e789b003